<title>USA: Consolidated Nov same-store sales off.</title>
<headline>Consolidated Nov same-store sales off.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMMBUS, Ohio 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		1996	 1995	  Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	 $373.5     $166.4	+124.5    -2.1</p>
<p>Year-to-date$1,856.0   $1,111.0    +67.1     +3.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Month is  four  weeks ended November 30.</p>
<p>Full company name is Consolidated Stores Corp</p>
<p>NOTE - The company, when reporting same store sales, follows the National Retail Federation adjusted calendar that results in the month of November having only two shopping days after Thanksgiving this year, compared to nine shopping days after Thanksgiving last year, it said.</p>
</text>
